  "description": "Demolition of existing rear single-storey extension and adjoining conservatory to allow for the erection of a new side and rear single-storey extension, as well as a loft conversion with rear dormer, to an existing semi-detached property in Mill Hill East.\n\nThe front and flank elevations are in brick with rendered skirtings to match the existing vernacular. The rear extension is clad in treated external timber, to create a visual separation between the old and new, whilst increasing the biodiversity in the area. New glazing to the rear will take benefit of the southern light, with the extension increasing usable living space to support multigenerational family living.\n\nThe rear extension will extend 3.5m from the original host property rear elevation (based on pre-app advice received on 22/7/25 Ref: 25/8199/QCH",
